ttle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1055","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[69,68,61,42,51,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1006505","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10250","city":"CS1057","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[69,68,61,42,51,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1006505","helmet":"WP1020905"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东吴将领，官至公安督。凤凰元年，步阐降晋，晋车骑将军羊祜率步军五万进攻江陵，意图牵制吴军主力。陆抗令公安督孙遵在长江南岸机动防御，防备羊祜军南渡。孙遵成功完成巡防任务，使羊祜无法突破南岸。凤凰三年，孙遵与李承率兵攻击江夏，被晋江夏太守嵇喜击败。","tc":"東吳將領，官至公安督。鳳凰元年，步闡降晉，晉車騎將軍羊祜率步軍五萬進攻江陵，意圖牽制吳軍主力。陸抗令公安督孫遵在長江南岸機動防御，防備羊祜軍南渡。孫遵成功完成巡防任務，使羊祜無法突破南岸。鳳凰三年，孫遵與李承率兵攻擊江夏，被晉江夏太守嵇喜擊敗。","en":"A general of Eastern Wu who rose to Commander of Gong'an. In the 1st year of Fenghuang, Bu Chan surrendered to Jin, and Jin's Marshal Yang Hu led 50,000 infantry to attack Jiangling, attempting to pin down the main Wu army. Lu Kang ordered Commander of Gong'an Sun Zun to maintain a mobile defense along the south bank of the Yangtze River to guard against Yang Hu's forces crossing south. Sun Zun successfully completed his patrol mission, preventing Yang Hu from breaching the south bank. In the 3rd year of Fenghuang, Sun Zun and Li Cheng led troops to attack Jiangxia, but were defeated by Ji Xi, Jin's Governor of Jiangxia.","jp":"東呉の武将。官位は公安督に至った。鳳凰元年、歩闡が晋に降ると、晋の車騎将軍羊祜が歩兵五万を率いて江陵を攻撃し、呉軍の主力を牽制しようとした。陸抗は公安督の孫遵に長江南岸で機動防御を行わせ、羊祜軍の南渡を防がせた。孫遵は見事に巡防任務を果たし、羊祜に南岸を突破させなかった。鳳凰三年、孫遵は李承と共に兵を率いて江夏を攻撃したが、晋の江夏太守嵇喜に撃破された。","kr":"동오의 장수로 관직은 공안독에 이르렀다. 봉황 원년, 보천이 진나라에 항복하자 진나라의 거기장군 양호가 보병 5만을 이끌고 강릉을 공격하여 오군 주력을 견제하려 했다. 육항은 공안독 손준에게 장강 남안에서 기동 방어를 펼쳐 양호군의 남하와 도하를 방비하도록 명했다. 손준은 순찰 방어 임무를 성공적으로 완수하여 양호가 남안을 돌파하지 못하도록 막아냈다. 봉황 3년, 손준은 이승과 함께 군사를 이끌고 강하를 공격했으나 진나라 강하태수 혜희에게 패했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1036615","remark":"普武","surname":"孙","surnameTc":"孫","surnameEn":"Sun","surnameJp":"孫","surnameKr":"손","surnameOther":"","name":"遵","nameTc":"遵","nameEn":"Zun","nameJp":"遵","nameKr":"준","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"孙遵","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"0","workYear":"220","city":"CS1055","gender":"0","rule":"69","force":"68","wise":"61","politics":"42","charm":"51","will":"70","ruleTalent":"8","forceTalent":"7","wiseTalent":"5","politicsTalent":"4","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"40/40/68/40/50/30/20/50","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5000","battleSoulPoint":"4300","debateSoulPoint":"3400","strategy":"","strategy2":"1003801","professions":"3/0/0/1/0/3/2/0/0/0/2/2/2/0/3/1/1/1/1/0/0/2/1/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"4","compatible":"86","loyalty":"0","reputation":"1000","evaluate":"3000","title":"","rank":"9","birth":"235","show":"249","death":"296","age":"0","injury":"","deathReason":"0","type":"1","npcTag":"0","npcNum":"1","microScene":"0","isImportant":"0","speaking":"3","weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1006505","helmet":"WP1020905","treasure":"","horse":"","shield":"","character":"0/1;1/1;18/1;26/1;57/1;44/1;30/0;3/0","father":"","mother":"","children":"","family":"","modInfo":"","brother":"","couple":"","otherRelationship":"","belief":"0","isVIP":"0","startVIPYear":"0","endVIPYear":"0","description":"东吴将领，官至公安督。凤凰元年，步阐降晋，晋车骑将军羊祜率步军五万进攻江陵，意图牵制吴军主力。陆抗令公安督孙遵在长江南岸机动防御，防备羊祜军南渡。孙遵成功完成巡防任务，使羊祜无法突破南岸。凤凰三年，孙遵与李承率兵攻击江夏，被晋江夏太守嵇喜击败。","descriptionTc":"東吳將領，官至公安督。鳳凰元年，步闡降